@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@contentType = application/json

### Healthcheck Memgraph
GET {{baseUrl}}/people/memgraph/test
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### Listar personas
GET {{baseUrl}}/people/
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### Obtener persona por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/people/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### Crear persona
POST {{baseUrl}}/people/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Ana",
  "age": 28
}

###

### Crear otra persona
POST {{baseUrl}}/people/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

{
  "id": 2,
  "name": "Luis",
  "age": 35
}

###

### Actualizar persona completa o parcial
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/people/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Ana Maria",
  "age": 29
}

###

### Actualizar solo nombre
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/people/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Ana López"
}

###

### Actualizar solo edad
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/people/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

{
  "age": 30
}

###

### Eliminar persona
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/people/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

###
